  "title": "Navbar, hero and card stack: your 13 comments",
  "lede": "The navbar on sideways phones follows the scroll and stays while the hero shows; the hero has least and greatest sizes for its parts; the card stack lost its coloured hairlines, its drawings follow the open part of the card, titles come from a blur and a finished card's pill stays pinned for a moment. Measured in Chromium against the build of main (PR #8), at 22 screen sizes and in sweeps of width and height.",
  "footer": "Measured Oct 19, 2026 in headless Chromium (software WebGL), on main at 4fcedce (before) and branch stack-hero-nav (after). Real-device checks on an iPhone are still to do: see Next."
 },
